WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Hey everyone, switching the voltage on this station is really simple.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.820
Once you open it, you'll see this panel here.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.960
You'll remove this panel — the three screws.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.160
And take out this part, which is the power supply.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.540
I'm using a drill, but a screwdriver works too.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:30.940
Once you remove it, on the bottom

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.000
you'll see right here

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.380
this label saying this is where you switch the voltage.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:40.400
And below it, the current voltage is shown.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.460
220.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.360
You'll use the same screwdriver you opened the station with

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.060
to fit it here and push it forward.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.720
That's how you switch the voltage on the 40-slot station

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.240
and on the 20-slot one too.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.280
To switch back, it's simple:

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.120
fit the screwdriver here and push it forward.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.500
That's how you switch the voltage.
